# Formspree public endpoint (baked into the client bundle — no secrets).
# Full URL, e.g. https://formspree.io/f/xxxxx
# Leave empty to keep form disabled-safe (shows soft error + hello@nautila.ma).
PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=
# Alias also accepted by Contact if you prefer an ID only:
# PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ID=xxxxx  → posts to https://formspree.io/f/xxxxx
